# Knowledge layers — kept local, not versioned.
# `.codegraph/` and `graphify-out/` are derived and rebuild from the AST at zero cost.
# `lat.md/` is hand-authored and does NOT regenerate: whoever keeps it owns the only
# copy. Rebuild the other two with `codegraph init` and `graphify update .`.
.codegraph/
lat.md/
graphify-out/

